{
  "_comment": "AI 白模渲染器 · 局部重绘（inpaint）· 以白模渲染图为底，只在掩膜区域内重绘材质；depth/normal 双 ControlNet 继续锁形",
  "_slots": "3=KSampler(seed/denoise) 5=EmptyLatentImage(width/height) 6=正提示词 7=负提示词 10=depth图 11=normal图 20=depth强度 21=normal强度 8=SaveImage 31=inpaint底图 32=重绘掩膜图",
  "_notes": [
    "22/23 是 SetUnionControlNetType，用来告诉 Union 模型这两条链分别是 depth / normal（这两个 ID 不在 SLOTS 里，属内部节点）",
    "两条 ControlNet 链串联：6 →20→21→ 3.positive；7 →20→21→ 3.negative",
    "SLOTS 里的 12(ref_img) 与 30(redux) 故意不出现在本文件：两者都需要未安装的插件，且 ComfyUI 会校验所有节点的 class_type，写了反而报错。服务端填充时会自动跳过不存在的节点。",
    "掩膜语义：LoadImage → ImageToMask(red 通道)，255(白)=重绘、0(黑)=保留，符合直觉。",
    "不用 LoadImage 的 alpha 当 mask：ComfyUI 那边算的是 mask = 1 - alpha/255，即「透明处才重绘」，与直觉相反、极易搞错。",
    "出图尺寸由底图(clay.png)决定，不再来自 EmptyLatentImage。",
    "grow_mask_by=6：掩膜外扩几像素再重绘，接缝更自然。"
  ],
  "1": {
    "class_type": "CheckpointLoaderSimple",
    "inputs": {
      "ckpt_name": "RealVisXL_V5.0_Lightning_fp16.safetensors"
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "ControlNetLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "control_net_name": "controlnet-union-sdxl-1.0-promax.safetensors"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "ControlNetLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "control_net_name": "controlnet-union-sdxl-1.0-promax.safetensors"
    }
  },
  "22": {
    "class_type": "SetUnionControlNetType",
    "inputs": {
      "control_net": [
        "2",
        0
      ],
      "type": "depth"
    }
  },
  "23": {
    "class_type": "SetUnionControlNetType",
    "inputs": {
      "control_net": [
        "9",
        0
      ],
      "type": "normal"
    }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "EmptyLatentImage",
    "inputs": {
      "width": 1232,
      "height": 752,
      "batch_size": 1
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "",
      "clip": [
        "1",
        1
      ]
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "",
      "clip": [
        "1",
        1
      ]
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "placeholder_depth.png"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "placeholder_normal.png"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "_comment": "参考图（SLOTS: ref_img）。参考图只借配色/材质/光照，不替换形状",
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "placeholder_ref.png"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "_comment": "统一加载器：按 preset 自动配对 ipadapter + clip_vision（PLUS 对应 ip-adapter-plus_sdxl_vit-h + ViT-H）",
    "class_type": "IPAdapterUnifiedLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "model": [
        "1",
        0
      ],
      "preset": "PLUS (high strength)"
    }
  },
  "14": {
    "_comment": "参考图条件注入：SLOTS 的 ref_w 映射到 weight，ref_weight_type 映射到 weight_type",
    "class_type": "IPAdapterAdvanced",
    "inputs": {
      "model": [
        "13",
        0
      ],
      "ipadapter": [
        "13",
        1
      ],
      "image": [
        "12",
        0
      ],
      "weight": 0.55,
      "weight_type": "linear",
      "combine_embeds": "concat",
      "start_at": 0.0,
      "end_at": 1.0,
      "embeds_scaling": "V only"
    }
  },
  "20": {
    "class_type": "ControlNetApplyAdvanced",
    "inputs": {
      "positive": [
        "6",
        0
      ],
      "negative": [
        "7",
        0
      ],
      "control_net": [
        "22",
        0
      ],
      "image": [
        "10",
        0
      ],
      "strength": 0.65,
      "start_percent": 0.0,
      "end_percent": 1.0
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "class_type": "ControlNetApplyAdvanced",
    "inputs": {
      "positive": [
        "20",
        0
      ],
      "negative": [
        "20",
        1
      ],
      "control_net": [
        "23",
        0
      ],
      "image": [
        "11",
        0
      ],
      "strength": 0.45,
      "start_percent": 0.0,
      "end_percent": 1.0
    }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "seed": 0,
      "steps": 8,
      "cfg": 2.0,
      "sampler_name": "dpmpp_sde",
      "scheduler": "karras",
      "denoise": 1.0,
      "model": [
        "14",
        0
      ],
      "positive": [
        "21",
        0
      ],
      "negative": [
        "21",
        1
      ],
      "latent_image": [
        "34",
        0
      ]
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": [
        "3",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "1",
        2
      ]
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": {
      "images": [
        "4",
        0
      ],
      "filename_prefix": "ai_render_cn"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "placeholder_clay.png"
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "inpaint 底图（白模渲染图）"
    }
  },
  "32": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "placeholder_mask.png"
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "重绘区域掩膜（灰度，白=重绘）"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "class_type": "ImageToMask",
    "inputs": {
      "image": [
        "32",
        0
      ],
      "channel": "red"
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "掩膜图 → MASK（红通道）"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "class_type": "VAEEncodeForInpaint",
    "inputs": {
      "pixels": [
        "31",
        0
      ],
      "vae": [
        "1",
        2
      ],
      "mask": [
        "33",
        0
      ],
      "grow_mask_by": 6
    },
    "_meta": {
      "title": "inpaint 编码：只把掩膜区送去重绘"
    }
  }
}